{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:47 2026-09-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:47 2026-09-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:47 2026-09-13 HKT</p><p>大埔發生火警。今日（13日）早上10時08分，富善街63至65號地下一間餅店突然起火，並冒出大量濃煙。消防接報趕到，出動1隊煙帽隊和1條喉灌救，至早上10時25分將火救熄，正調查火警原因。事件中約50人自行疏散，無人受傷。</p><img alt=\"餅店失火。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/22d8eea90d5f55e9dfc652c2fc8b60d7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_09.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b9b4f0f7f80b0eefcdb653a2ee582574/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_10.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/822b937572b9bb324d272ab6400f841d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_09_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"餅店內一片熏黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1106350e727b6a25249d1a2730cc4d88/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_06.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/eabae143bedf651e2d65a1621ee8845b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ebb33419f635a3f2f73dc992a40f34cc/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_07_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/de8afadaf0e21994a05027a33b5f8c47/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_08.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d1293592318d9d9e3ae0ed9e0ba8d4d0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_07_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是富善街63至65號地下。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bb63f4626f8bc4bd7a2651caf1d62579/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_07.jpeg\"/><p>涉事餅店在大火中焚毀嚴重，舖內一片熏黑。據餅店負責人李先生表示，事發時餅店正製作紅棗糕，但爐頭突然失火。他苦訴預計需時逾月才可維修妥當，現時正值中秋佳節前夕，舖頭將無法再生產月餅，對生意影響很大。</p><img alt=\"李生指舖頭失火後，未能再製作月餅，對生意影響很大。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f26c04d3a3ed0f1463f5db7d4437e6ea/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_06_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"餅店內一片熏黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/eb971e59e0b272d0afef222371bf34bb/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_12_20_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員在場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b29a55e7a12fc727f5ed4690d4e7059c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_11_26_15.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/615bd52c9b6b35f85b01de12b411df31/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_11_26_13_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員將火救熄。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a0e31fbc69862b4004201d03e091ef64/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_11_26_13.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9253f8a4325102e0da6cfd875f5ef75c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_11_26_12_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防調查火警原因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/508911404074b048b69c892679c41163/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_11_26_12_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a33c6be436eab9ae9ce27d28cabd45db/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_11_26_12.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ef16748d1bd6d13b4e4ba82ee903d7d6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_11_26_11_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/72db7166a37f865dd754ecf09bfe938a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_11_26_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方封鎖涉事範圍。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8d186a32c474ba98efb1843a16af3d99/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_11_26_10_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"Threads「leung0921」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d8cd26775b81aecd8cb0b781477122b/2026-09/111_4.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防將火救熄。fb：大埔人大埔谷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce35377032a3978f1e6e3d22e4113579/2026-09/01_1_22.jpg\"/><img alt=\"富善街發生火警。fb：大埔人大埔谷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e4ffbac2f2242d8345c36bf7187c8de/2026-09/02_6_12.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T04:59:05.220230+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":23,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}